{
 "_readme": [
  "Rule tables for tools/format_commentary.py. Every rule has a stable id so a",
  "correction later is a data edit, not a parser rewrite.",
  "",
  "Sorted longest-first at load time, so 'केचित्तु' wins over 'केचित्' and",
  "'इत्यत उक्तम्' over 'उक्तम्'. Do not rely on the order here.",
  "",
  "introducers_exact match at the END of a word, not as standalone words:",
  "sandhi joins them, and the corpus's own 'कोषोक्तेराह' is exactly that case.",
  "introducers_family are morphological wildcards -- '*दयति' admits",
  "'प्रतिपादयति' -- never expanded to an unrestricted '.*'."
 ],
 "delimiters": {
  "_note": [
   "The spec was written in ASCII | and ||. The corpus uses U+0964 DANDA;",
   "a double danda is TWO U+0964, and U+0965 also occurs. All forms are",
   "accepted and none is ever rewritten into another."
  ],
  "single": [
   "।",
   "|"
  ],
  "double": [
   "।।",
   "॥",
   "||"
  ],
  "_p2_note": [
   "Pattern 2 is restricted to the ASCII pipe forms, and that is not fussiness.",
   "Section 11 defines it as delimiter + one or two words + delimiter, while",
   "section 29 forbids treating भिन्नेति ।। and द्वन्द्वत्वेति ।। as pratikas --",
   "and in danda-punctuated prose those two are the SAME shape. '. x ..' between",
   "two sentence dandas cannot be told from '| x |' by structure alone.",
   "",
   "Every Pattern-2 example in the specification is written with pipes, and the",
   "real corpus contains none, so restricting it here satisfies both sections:",
   "the rule fires wherever OCR genuinely uses a pipe, and never on ordinary",
   "sentence punctuation. Set to 'all' to widen it once pipe-bearing OCR exists",
   "to check against. Section 30: a false negative beats a destructive false",
   "positive."
  ]
 },
 "separators": {
  "_note": [
   "What may sit between an introducer and its pratika. The dash forms",
   "carry P1B, which is the shape the real corpus actually uses."
  ],
  "dashes": [
   "–",
   "—",
   "-"
  ]
 },
 "limits": {
  "p1_max_pratika_words": 8,
  "p2_max_words": 2,
  "p2_delimiters": "pipes_only"
 },
